      "text": "For Petitioner : Mr.V.Regunathan  For Respondents : Mr.E.Antony Sahaya Prabaha  Additional Public Prosecutor  ORDER This Criminal Original Petition is filed seeking for a direction to the second respondent Police to complete the investigation in Crime No.77 of 2022 and file a final report within a time stipulated by this Court.",
